# Test: a completed bulk action unticks its rows and releases the held refresh
# VALIDATES: spec-fleet-ui-1 user story 4 with the closure review's held
#            refresh finding -- the rows a bulk action was carried out on are
#            unticked when its answer arrives, so the live refresh they held
#            lands and the paused mark goes
# PREVENTS: rows left ticked after their action completed, which hold the
#           table's refresh for as long as the page stays open
#
# Question: does a completed bulk action end the hold its ticked rows made?
# Only a browser decides it: the untick follows the action's response header
# (X-Fleet-Selection-Done, pinned for the server by
# TestDevicesBulkDoneClearsTheSelection), and the release is fleet.js state.
# Method: the sample script is held, so the estate changes only when Step is
# pressed. core-par-02 is offline from the start, so the table filtered to
# state:offline holds its row; the first step takes cpe-lon-03 offline. The
# test ticks core-par-02, steps, and sees the hold and its mark. Add label,
# confirmed, is carried out on the ticked row: its toast arrives, the row is
# unticked, and the table then shows cpe-lon-03 with the mark gone. Every
# wait is on state the page shows, never on a time.

option=needs-build-tag:value=ze_fleet_ui_sample:state=present
option=env:var=ze.web.fleet.sample.held:value=true
option=timeout:value=90s
option=viewport:width=1600:height=1000

action=open:path=/fleet/estate/devices/?q=state%3Aoffline
expect=html:id=fleet-content:contains=core-par-02
expect=html:id=fleet-content:not-contains=cpe-lon-03
expect=attribute:selector=html:name=data-fleet-stream:value=open

action=click:text=Select core-par-02
expect=attribute:selector=tr.fleet-table-row--selected:name=class:contains=fleet-table-row--selected

action=click:id=fleet-proto-step
expect=attribute:selector=html:name=data-fleet-held:value=true
expect=element:text=Live updates are paused
expect=html:id=fleet-content:not-contains=cpe-lon-03

# The action is carried out on the ticked row: its rows are unticked, and the
# refresh they held lands.
action=click:text=button "Add label"
expect=html:id=fleet-confirm:contains=Add label
action=click:text=button "Confirm"
expect=html:id=fleet-toasts:contains=Add label, 1 device: core-par-02.
expect=html:id=fleet-content:contains=cpe-lon-03
expect=element:not-text=Live updates are paused
